[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2479314783","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99288#issuecomment-2479314783","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99288","id":2479314783,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Tx1df","user":{"login":"nikitalita","id":69168929,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5MTY4OTI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69168929?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita","html_url":"https://github.com/nikitalita","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nikitalita/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-15T16:04:45Z","updated_at":"2024-11-15T16:04:45Z","body":"The main problem is that the shaders get preprocessed before compiling, and preprocessing strips out all those comments before it’s passed to the compiler. \r\n\r\nI have something on my [shader conversion branch](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/87106) which would help fix this; basically, allowing the parser to parse non-preprocessed shader code. Perhaps on an error, it could be parsed again using this and use this for setting the line in the error output.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2479314783/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":